    {
      "id": "text-80",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 52,
      "text": "Trust and token boundaries",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-81",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 125,
      "y": 1005,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 175,
      "text": "A. The browser obtains a delegated Foundry user token and sends it only to the same-origin FastAPI endpoint.\nB. FastAPI validates the token, adds the server-held APIM subscription key, and forwards to Agent APIM. The key never reaches the browser.\nC. Agent APIM validates and relays the user token to Foundry without replacing the identity.\nD. The agent direct MCP tool uses an OAuth2 project connection to obtain a delegated MCP token for the account completing consent.\nE. MCP APIM preserves that token, and Azure MCP uses OBO so downstream Azure RBAC is evaluated for the authorizing user.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "originalText": "A. The browser obtains a delegated Foundry user token and sends it only to the same-origin FastAPI endpoint.\nB. FastAPI validates the token, adds the server-held APIM subscription key, and forwards to Agent APIM. The key never reaches the browser.\nC. Agent APIM validates and relays the user token to Foundry without replacing the identity.\nD. The agent direct MCP tool uses an OAuth2 project connection to obtain a delegated MCP token for the account completing consent.\nE. MCP APIM preserves that token, and Azure MCP uses OBO so downstream Azure RBAC is evaluated for the authorizing user."
    },
    {
      "id": "text-82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1165,
      "width": 1760,
      "height": 38,
      "text": "Solid arrows = runtime calls   |   Dashed purple arrows = token issuance / identity relationship   |   OAuth client secret stays in the Foundry project connection",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "originalText": "Solid arrows = runtime calls   |   Dashed purple arrows = token issuance / identity relationship   |   OAuth client secret stays in the Foundry project connection"
    },
